  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "MiaAI-Lab TensorFold v0.6.0 with five patches for image/video input, YaRN, FP8 KV and pooled attention cache. Runs the creator-published ARM64 image tagged v0.6.0-fb91a0019fdc. Vontra MLX 4-bit target with z-lab DFlash2 drafter; eight streams and a 262,144-token window. KV caches grow on demand using upstream\u2019s supported zero-pool mode instead of pinning its 78 GiB maximum at startup. The conservative 109 GiB memory envelope is retained; actual allocation depends on active requests. Physical Spark execution and model quality are unmeasured here.",
    "tags": [
      "qwen3.8",
      "tensorfold",
      "dflash2",
      "vision",
      "video",
      "fp8-kv",
      "spark"
    ],
    "title": "Qwen3.8 27B TensorFold single Spark (Mia)"
